{"name": "test_order_total_equals_subtotals", "status": "passed", "description": "\n订单总金额 = 各商品小计之和\n\n这是金额计算正确性验证。\n如果服务端算错了总价（比如少算了运费、多算了折扣），这条用例会失败。\n\n知识点：为什么用 .get(\"subtotal\", ...) ？\n  因为不一定所有服务端都返回 subtotal 字段。\n  如果没有 subtotal，就用 price * quantity 自己算。\n  这种防御性写法让用例更健壮。\n", "attachments": [{"name": "log", "source": "34c2fe1e-399e-4444-b226-723a9b0a4182-attachment.txt", "type": "text/plain"}, {"name": "stdout", "source": "52d2affd-7320-46a4-be3c-d4fefa8da783-attachment.txt", "type": "text/plain"}], "start": 1789020183397, "stop": 1789020183592, "uuid": "36d76c8b-373f-4506-bf36-9eda583877df", "historyId": "64611afdaaf902642f4481834dc847a4", "testCaseId": "64611afdaaf902642f4481834dc847a4", "fullName": "test_cases.test_data_consistency.TestOrderConsistency#test_order_total_equals_subtotals", "labels": [{"name": "tag", "value": "p1"}, {"name": "tag", "value": "order"}, {"name": "tag", "value": "regression"}, {"name": "parentSuite", "value": "test_cases"}, {"name": "suite", "value": "test_data_consistency"}, {"name": "subSuite", "value": "TestOrderConsistency"}, {"name": "host", "value": "LAPTOP-M45JDNDM"}, {"name": "thread", "value": "9740-MainThread"}, {"name": "framework", "value": "pytest"}, {"name": "language", "value": "cpython3"}, {"name": "package", "value": "test_cases.test_data_consistency"}]}